# TBCGuide - Dwarf & Gnome start: Coldridge Valley and Dun Morogh (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_DwarfGnome_DunMorogh
@name Coldridge Valley & Dun Morogh
@faction Alliance
@races Dwarf,Gnome
@levels 1-11
@zone Dun Morogh
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Dwarf and gnome starting route. Coldridge Valley to about level 5, then Kharanos, the Barleybrew and Amberstill farms and the eastern pass. Ends at about level 11 at the gate to Loch Modan.
@next A_LochModan

accept The Boar Hunter | Talin Keeneye, west of Anvilmar.
accept A Refugee's Quandary | Felix Whindlebolt, north of Anvilmar.
accept Dwarven Outfitters | Sten Stoutarm, in front of Anvilmar.
complete Dwarven Outfitters | Wolves around Anvilmar drop Tough Wolf Meat.
turnin Dwarven Outfitters
accept 3106 Simple Rune [class=Warrior; race=Dwarf] | Sten Stoutarm gives your class letter now.
accept 3107 Consecrated Rune [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
