accept A New Threat
complete A New Threat | Rockjaw Troggs and Burly Rockjaw Troggs in the valley.
complete The Boar Hunter | Small Crag Boars west of Anvilmar.
complete A Refugee's Quandary | Felix's chest, box and bucket are in the camps of the trolls.
